msgctxt "56_Poppo Manager"
msgid "Hello, Akiyama-san."
msgstr "Hola, Akiyama-san."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "68_Akiyama"
msgid "Yo. How's business?"
msgstr "Hola. ¿Cómo va el negocio?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "80_Poppo Manager"
msgid "You know, I gotta say, the competition's pretty fierce...\\r\nThrow in some shoplifters, and it's a real struggle."
msgstr "Sinceramente, en la ciudad hay mucha competencia...\\r\nEso, sumado a la cantidad de robos, resulta abrumador."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "92_Akiyama"
msgid "Sounds rough. Listen, can you do me a favor and let me know\\r\nif you see this guy?"
msgstr "Suena difícil. Oiga, ¿podría llamarme si llega a ver a este tipo?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "104_Poppo Manager"
msgid "...This some kinda  Rorschach test?"
msgstr "¿Qué es esto? ¿Una prueba de Rorschach?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "116_Akiyama"
msgid "A what now? No, supposedly, the resemblance is uncanny.\\r\nSo if you see him..."
msgstr "¿Rors- qué? No. Pero, supuestamente se parece a quién busco.\\r\nAsí que, si lo ve..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "128_Poppo Manager"
msgid "You got it."
msgstr "Está bien."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "152_Akiyama"
msgid "(Now to stop by Volcano... Lots of people there.)"
msgstr "(Ahora pasare por Volcano... Allí anda mucha gente)."

